## Interface: 120100, 16001
## Title: ApexGatherer
## Notes: The gathering addon for WoW Forever: records Mining, Herbalism, Fishing and Treasure nodes on your maps, builds short farming routes from them, shows it all on a HUD while you farm, and swaps nodes with your guild.
## Version: 2.1.0
## SavedVariables: ApexGathererDB, ApexGathererNodes, ApexGathererRoutes
